{"case_id":"SMELL-013-N01","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"n01-trigger","kind":"policy_clause","text":"If the insured disputes the amount of loss after receiving the estimate, the dispute must be referred under the valuation dispute path.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-policy-n01","source_type":"policy_form","document_version":"HO-N01-v5","section":"Loss Settlement / Dispute","jurisdiction":"KY","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n01-route","kind":"workflow_step","text":"Within two business days of a written dispute, the adjuster opens a Valuation Review case and routes it to the Property Resolution Unit.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-workflow-n01","source_type":"claims_workflow","document_version":"claims-ops-n01-v8","section":"Valuation Review / Handoff","jurisdiction":"KY","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n01-authority","kind":"authority_matrix","text":"The Property Resolution Unit supervisor is the accountable decision owner for valuation disputes exceeding the adjuster's authority.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-workflow-n01","source_type":"claims_workflow","document_version":"claims-ops-n01-v8","section":"Authority Matrix / Valuation","jurisdiction":"KY","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n01-deadline","kind":"service_level","text":"The Property Resolution Unit must acknowledge the dispute within two business days and issue a determination or next-step notice within ten business days.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-workflow-n01","source_type":"claims_workflow","document_version":"claims-ops-n01-v8","section":"Valuation Review / Service Levels","jurisdiction":"KY","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n01-trigger","target":"n01-route","type":"handled_by"},{"source":"n01-route","target":"n01-authority","type":"owned_by"},{"source":"n01-route","target":"n01-deadline","type":"constrained_by"}],"expected":{"smell_id":"SMELL-013","label":"negative","required_evidence_roles":["valuation_dispute_trigger","escalation_route","escalation_actor","escalation_deadline"]}}
{"case_id":"SMELL-013-N02","label":"negative","nodes":[{"node_id":"n02-trigger","kind":"policy_clause","text":"A disagreement over the amount of covered damage follows the appraisal procedure described in this condition.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-policy-n02","source_type":"policy_form","document_version":"HO-N02-v1","section":"Conditions / Appraisal","jurisdiction":"IN","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n02-appraisal-route","kind":"workflow_step","text":"Each party selects a competent appraiser within five calendar days after written demand. The two appraisers select an umpire, and the written demand is submitted through the Claim Dispute Portal.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-policy-n02","source_type":"claims_procedure","document_version":"appraisal-procedure-n02-v3","section":"Appraisal / Route","jurisdiction":"IN","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n02-actor","kind":"role_definition","text":"The Claims Dispute Coordinator owns the portal intake, confirms the appraiser assignments, and sends unresolved matters to the named umpire panel.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-workflow-n02","source_type":"claims_workflow","document_version":"claims-ops-n02-v2","section":"Dispute Coordination / Ownership","jurisdiction":"IN","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}},{"node_id":"n02-deadline","kind":"service_level","text":"The coordinator must acknowledge a demand within one business day and record the umpire appointment within seven calendar days.","metadata":{"source_id":"synthetic-workflow-n02","source_type":"claims_workflow","document_version":"claims-ops-n02-v2","section":"Dispute Coordination / Service Level","jurisdiction":"IN","provenance_status":"synthetic_fixture"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n02-trigger","target":"n02-appraisal-route","type":"handled_under"},{"source":"n02-appraisal-route","target":"n02-actor","type":"coordinated_by"},{"source":"n02-appraisal-route","target":"n02-deadline","type":"has_deadline"}],"expected":{"smell_id":"SMELL-013","label":"negative","required_evidence_roles":["valuation_dispute_trigger","escalation_route","escalation_actor","escalation_deadline"]}}
